(* eh2-pq-dh-broken.pv - "harvest now, decrypt later" with X25519 broken: after
   the sessions the attacker learns every X25519 secret - both identity keys
   and every ephemeral - but not the ML-KEM keys. SK must stay secret: the
   hybrid's confidentiality rests on ML-KEM alone here. *)
query attacker(secretI) phase 1.
query attacker(secretR) phase 1.

process World | LeakStatics | LeakEphemerals
